// 6015
[enum_6015]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Raptor]	Running. Waste of time, unless you're chasing after a monster.
val=2,[Thok]	Metal-man, races can be fun. Me and brother Marm would race to kill as many monsters as possible.
val=3,[Raptor]	That kind of race I can get behind.
val=11,[Troll]	Hur-hur, running good. Me look forward to running event.
val=12,[Thok]	Ha! Yes, my rocky friend, Thok thinks this will be good.
val=21,[Troll]	How do mermaids run when they have no legs?
val=22,[Tentacle]	With difficulty. 
val=23,[Troll]	Humans also run badly with no legs. That's why I eat legs first. 
val=31,[Mr Mordaut]	It's a misconception that athletics is solely about strength and speed.
val=32,[Mr Mordaut]	It can be very tactical. The brain is just as important as the feet.
val=33,[Zombie]	Brains...taste better than feet...
val=34,[Mr Mordaut]	So, use your mind to take advantage of your opponents.
val=41,[Mr Mordaut]	Some people compare running to a card game, with all the mind games and luck that entails.
val=42,[Thok]	Thok like card games. Snap is a big favourite after a glass of mead.
val=43,[Mr Mordaut]	I was thinking of a more intricate card game.
val=44,[Thok]	Snap with two packs of cards? 
val=45,[Mr Mordaut]	Something like that, yes.
val=51,[Thok]	Welcome to the Games! I am Thok, champion of Daemonheim, drinker of mead, son of Daddy Thok...
val=52,[Mr Mordaut]	Deary me. People are here to watch the games, not hear about you.
val=53,[Mr Mordaut]	Welcome. My name is Mr. Mordaut and it is my honour to commentate on this event.
val=61,[Mr Mordaut]	Welcome, everyone. My name is Mr. Mordaut and my colleague here is known as ...um...zombie.
val=62,[Zombie]	So...many...people... So many brains.
val=63,[Mr Mordaut]	Indeed, we really have a good turnout today.
default=

// 6016
[enum_6016]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Raptor]	Not bad. I'm impressed, should use your speed to chase down monsters.
val=2,[Thok]	Thok agree with metal man. Chase monsters, then crush them with your fists.
val=11,[Thok]	A good race, Thok think this was great.
val=12,[Troll]	Hur hur, me like fast food.
val=13,[Thok]	Thok see what you did there!
val=21,[Troll]	Little human ran well. Might be too fast for me to eat them.
val=22,[Thok]	No eating the athletes! Thok want to see more races.
val=23,[Troll]	Okay.
val=31,[Tentacle]	They run faster than I can swim!
val=32,[Troll]	They not run faster than troll can swim.
val=33,[Tentacle]	Aren't you made of rock? No troll can swim.
val=34,[Troll]	Look at it this way: trolls swim very fast downwards.
val=41,[Mr Mordaut]	This athlete really has got their head in the game.
val=42,[Zombie]	Zombie go into game, eat head?
val=43,[Mr Mordaut]	No, zombie. We can snack at the post-race buffet.
val=44,[Zombie]	Mmm...brain canapes.
val=51,[Thok]	Athlete run like the wind!
val=52,[Mr Mordaut]	I'd say at least gale force 10.
val=53,[Thok]	Thok say they have turned it right up to 11!
val=61,[Thok]	Thok thought that was...BEST EVENT EVER!
val=62,[Mr Mordaut]	Yes, quite. Well done, athlete, a remarkable score that you should be proud of.
val=71,[Mr Mordaut]	Well done athlete, a fantastic event and a score to be proud of.
val=72,[Thok]	*Belch*
val=73,[Mr Mordaut]	Have you been drinking?
val=74,[Thok]	S'victory drink. I shtarted drinkings thish morning jusht incashe. S'good game. Good game.
default=

// 6017
[enum_6017]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Tentacle]	I'd give up now if I were you, human.	
val=2,[Thok]	I have faith in athlete. 	
val=11,[Thok]	Not good so far. Think more like Thok, be more like Thok!	
val=12,[Tentacle]	You really are full of yourself.	
val=13,[Thok]	Thok is full of Thok! Fish-woman is correct.	
val=21,[Tentacle]	Haha, that was a terrible round.	
val=22,[Thok]	Do not be rude, squishy fishy. Thok don't like rude people.	
val=23,[Tentacle]	I'm not scared of you, you great oaf.	
val=24,*THWACK*
val=25,[Tentacle]	Such pretty butterflies...I think I'll take a nap now.	
val=31,[Mr Mordaut]	A disappointing last round, but I'm sure our athlete can recover.	
val=32,[Thok]	Can't do much worse.	
val=41,[Mr Mordaut]	A disappointing score for our athlete.
val=42,[Mr Mordaut]	I'm sure they'll do better in future attempts.	
default=

// 6018
[enum_6018]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Thok]	Wow, watch them go!	
val=2,[Thok]	They faster than Thok going through Daemonheim!	
val=3,[Zombie]	Slow down! Too fast for Zombie!	
val=4,[Mr Mordaut]	We might see a new Games world record here.	
val=5,[Tentacle]	How they can go so fast? Someone must be cheating.	
val=6,[Troll]	A rolling troll gathers no moss!	
default=

// 6019
[enum_6019]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Thok]	By Thok's mighty beard, what is that thing?	
val=2,[Troll]	Hur hur...wait, what is dat?	
val=3,[Troll]	What is dis...Troll don't know.	
val=4,[Tentacle]	That is very, very strange.	
val=5,[Mr Mordaut]	Holy dragonkin, is that a tutu?	
val=6,[Zombie]	I like my brains like I like my bacon...streaky	
default=

// 6020
[enum_6020]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Raptor]	How did that get there?	
val=2,[Troll]	Is food falling from sky now?	
val=3,[Troll]	Someone has a beef wiv dis race	
val=4,[Thok]	Holy cow!	
val=5,[Thok]	Did someone order a cow?	
val=6,[Zombie]	All-you-can-eat buffet!	
default=

// 6021
[enum_6021]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Thok]	Giving up? Thok fought on with worse injuries.	
val=2,[Thok]	Ow, Thok think that must have hurt.	
val=3,[Thok]	Don't give up in face of adversity! Punch it in nose!	
val=4,[Raptor]	Not impressed. Had worse wounds.	
val=5,[Troll]	If they not in race, can Troll eat them?	
val=6,[Tentacle]	I've seen sea cucumbers move faster.	
val=7,[Zombie]	Weak ones...easier to stumble after...	
default=

// 6022
[enum_6022]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Raptor]	Waste of time. Should be killing things.	
val=2,[Troll]	But look at the pretty shiny rocks and trees.	
val=3,[Raptor]	I should kill you where you stand, monster.	
val=4,[Troll]	Wanna see them collect shiny things. Yay shiny!	
val=11,[Troll]	Yay, a race! Collect all the shinies, yay!	
val=12,[Raptor]	Bah.	
val=21,[Troll]	Troll don't get this race.	
val=22,[Zombie]	Grab stuff...in short space of time...	
val=23,[Troll]	Do they eat them?	
val=24,[Zombie]	No...but we eat athletes later...yes?	
val=31,[Tentacle]	Why are you surface dwellers fascinated with collecting things?	
val=32,[Mr Mordaut]	It's a compulsion. We dragons are probably the worst of the bunch.	
val=33,[Tentacle]	You sit on a hoard of gold?	
val=34,[Mr Mordaut]	Well, yes, but I only collect the rare coins. I have an Avarrocka guinea, would you believe...	
val=35,[Tentacle]	Dragon geek!	
val=41,[Thok]	Lemme guess, Zombie - you collect brains.	
val=42,[Zombie]	Gotta...collect...em...all	
val=43,[Thok]	Haha! Thok thinks you just eat brains. This race all about collecting and keeping.	
val=51,[Raptor]	Where is the killing? Why aren't the competitors hitting each other?	
val=52,[Mr Mordaut]	It's strictly a non-contact sport.	
val=53,[Raptor]	Fine. Then why aren't the competitors throwing axes at each other?	
val=54,[Mr Mordaut]	That's still contact, Raptor. Just...at a distance.	
val=61,[Mr Mordaut]	Grabbing what you can in a short space of time. A metaphor for life, eh Thok?	
val=62,[Thok]	I not know metaphor. My family talks with each other, not use flags.	
val=63,[Mr Mordaut]	Good lord, I didn't mean semaphor! You have a beautiful mind, Thok.	
default=

// 6023
[enum_6023]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Raptor]	Heh. Good choice.	
val=2,[Raptor]	That resource? Not impressed.	
val=3,[Raptor]	That would be better in weapon form.	
val=4,[Troll]	Why do they not eating that?	
val=5,[Troll]	Is that a good one to get?	
val=6,[Troll]	Yay! Troll woulda picked dat one!	
val=7,[Tentacle]	Grab, grab, grab! The time is ticking down.	
val=8,[Tentacle]	Grab that one...over there! No, the other one!	
val=9,[Tentacle]	Pick that one up to your left! No, your other left!	
val=10,[Mr Mordaut]	It's a frenzy of picking things up!	
val=11,[Mr Mordaut]	They've missed one there. That might cost them.	
val=12,[Mr Mordaut]	Use your body and your brain if you want to win the game!	
val=13,[Zombie]	Run...fleshy brainbags...	
val=14,[Zombie]	A winner is one who...traaaains	
val=15,[Thok]	Grab and pillage!	
val=16,[Thok]	You snooze, you lose!	
val=17,[Thok]	Thok mentally high-fives all of you!	
default=

// 6024
[enum_6024]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Thok]	A performance to sing tales of! It tough for anyone to top that.	
val=2,[Mr Mordaut]	A marvellous display. I've not seen such skill for at least two centuries.	
val=11,[Raptor]	Impressed. Good event.	
val=12,[Tentacle]	Yes, good round...	
val=13,[Raptor]	Don't try to escape me fish. I'll be coming after you.	
val=14,[Tentacle]	Eep!	
val=21,[Raptor]	Good event. I'm impressed.	
val=22,[Mr Mordaut]	Indeed. A great performance from our athlete.	
val=23,[Raptor]	Now, dragon, time to meet my flail!	
val=24,[Mr Mordaut]	*Sigh* Oh, do go away, Raptor.	
val=31,[Mr Mordaut]	Wonderful! A fantastic show. Bravo athlete, bravo!	
val=32,[Raptor]	Heh. Good event. I'm impressed.	
val=41,[Thok]	Haha! A good round! Well done, squishy person!	
val=42,[Tentacle]	Squishy person...really?	
val=43,*THWACK*
val=44,[Tentacle]	Why are there two of you?	
val=51,[Thok]	Keep it up, squishy athlete, and you'll be almost as good as Thok.	
val=61,[Thok]	A good game, you make Thok proud.	
val=62,[Tentacle]	Yes human well do-	
val=63,*THWACK*
val=64,[Tentacle]	What was that for?	
val=65,[Thok]	Sorry, Thok thought you were about to make rude comment.	
default=

// 6025
[enum_6025]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Tentacle]	A pitiful performance. I thought humans were meant to be good at this?	
val=2,[Thok]	Thok sure they just limbering up. They must be rusty.	
val=11,[Tentacle]	Hah! Better luck next time, human.	
val=21,[Thok]	Thok can hardly look.	
val=22,[Mr Mordaut]	It's not that bad. I'm sure that was just a practice game.	
val=31,[Mr Mordaut]	A disappointing performance from our athlete. I'm sure they can come back and do better.	
val=32,[Zombie]	Zombie...could do better...with half an arm...	
val=41,[Raptor]	Not impressed. Seems like a practice round.	
val=42,[Tentacle]	Or they're just not very good.	
val=51,[Tentacle]	Not the best score I've ever seen.	
val=52,[Raptor]	Seen better.	
val=61,[Raptor]	Bad score. Not impressed.	
val=62,[Mr Mordaut]	Come now, my metal-encased friend, I'm sure this was just a practice game.	
val=63,[Mr Mordaut]	With drive and determination, they'll have a top score in no time.	
default=

// 6026
[enum_6026]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Mr Mordaut]	Five Ages. Years of conflict and learning, and our collective culture gives us cheese. Down a hill.	
val=2,[Thok]	Cheese rolling is Thok's favourite! CHEESE ROLL - CHEESE ROLL - CHEESE ROLL.	
val=3,[Mr Mordaut]	Heavens preserve me.	
val=11,[Troll]	Cheese is rubbish. Milk is better.	
val=12,[Tentacle]	You're not meant to troll the cheese, you're meant to roll the cheese!	
val=21,[Troll]	Look! Cheese roll much better when it in a circle...	
val=22,[Tentacle]	You are kidding me. Are you saying that trolls haven't invented the wheel yet?	
val=23,[Troll]	Troll can think of many uses for it! 	
val=24,[Troll]	After games, Troll go back and tell friends about dis 'wheel'.	
val=31,[Mr Mordaut]	You a fan of cheese, Zombie? You kick back in the evening with some cheese and crackers?	
val=32,[Zombie]	Zombie tried...cheese brains once...	
val=33,[Mr Mordaut]	Interesting. Were they moreish? A bit 'Oooh, just one more brain'.	
val=34,[Zombie]	They're...cheap...but...unsatisfying.	
val=41,[Raptor]	I refuse to be here while someone rolls cheese.	
val=42,[Thok]	Why, Raptor? Bad history with cheese? 	
val=43,[Raptor]	No, that's not wh-	
val=44,[Thok]	Eat too much cheese and have bad Raptor nightmare?	
val=45,[Raptor]	If you'll excuse me, I have strykewyrms to kill.	
val=51,[Mr Mordaut]	This reminds me of a joke. What did mother bear scream at baby bear when he was running in a cheese rolling race?	
val=52,[Mr Mordaut]	Come-on-bear! 	
default=

// 6027
[enum_6027]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Mr Mordaut]	That could have been feta!	
val=2,[Mr Mordaut]	Ooh, they really milked that performance.	
val=3,[Tentacle]	Like the cheese, that performance stank.	
val=4,[Tentacle]	Have a nice trip!	
val=5,[Thok]	Look on bright side: ten-second rule means the cheese is good to eat.	
val=6,[Thok]	Athlete is clearly merry on mead.	
val=7,[Raptor]	Not impressed.	
val=8,[Raptor]	Heh.	
default=

// 6028
[enum_6028]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,[Mr Mordaut]	That was a gouda performance!	
val=2,[Mr Mordaut]	You really are the big cheese	
val=3,[Mr Mordaut]	You're on a roll.	
val=4,[Mr Mordaut]	You better grab some of that cheese because your performance was a cracker!	
val=5,[Tentacle]	Congratulations! You have a talent for fermented bovine secretions.	
val=6,[Thok]	Carve that cheese into a crown! No one beats that score.	
val=7,[Zombie]	That's....how...I roll.	
default=

