val=167,Help establish a haven for the scoundrels and footpads of the land, and pull off some world-class heists to raise your roguish renown!
val=181,Respond to an unconventional challenge by Rabid Jack's pirates and thwart their latest plan to rule the sea!
val=182,A huge fish has been terrorising the northern seas. Help a fisherman end the horror stories by catching beast!
val=179,Help re-establish a simian society in an unlikely locale.
val=172,Unravel the mysteries of body energy in the Elemental Workshop!
val=180,Decipher the conundrums of the chaotic cosmos in the Elemental Workshop!
val=160,A message from an unknown benefactor leads Veldaban to strike against a forgotten threat.
val=149,See old friends in new ways as you delve into their past and help them settle their differences.
val=17,Help a love-sick dwarf pursue the unlikely object of his affections!
val=14,Help the dwarven capital through a crisis and find the long-lost heir to its throne.
val=168,The Wise Old man's past comes back to haunt him - and you!
val=162,A dark figure looms with mysterious intent. Find out what he's up to and stop it!
val=187,Solve a brutal murder and restore harmony to the Abbey of Saint Elspeth.
val=171,Rumours of pest sightings on the mainland have reached the ears of the Void Knights. Has a pest managed to slip past their defences?
val=176,The planets have aligned, signalling the Ritual of the Mahjarrat. If he becomes rejuvenated, with an arsenal of weapons taken from the gods themselves, will you be able to stop Lucien achieving total dominance?
val=192,The men of Rimmington have entered a deep sleep. Help save them from their shared dreams.
val=152,Discover the truth behind a friend's destiny and take part in the cave goblins' last stand.
val=190,TzHaar eggs are hatching into Ga'al - TzHaar without inborn memories needed to perform their traditional caste roles. Travel with one of these Ga'al to search for a way to bestow these memories upon him, unearthing the secrets of the TzHaar race.
val=191,A group of adventurers needs your help to guide them through a foreboding cavern, but a simple excursion soon turns into an underground nightmare.
val=151,There are penguins and a submarine. What more do you need to know?
val=174,Confront the mastermind behind the pests on the mainland, and send them back where they came from!
val=150,Join Erjolf in his quest for a trophy, unravel the puzzling story behind a curious corpse, and discover the dark secrets of one of the most fearsome races ever to walk in Gielinor.
val=173,Continue your hunt for the elusive escaped pests, and your investigations into how they came to escape.
val=131,Help Pikkupstix find out what happened to his wayward apprentice.
val=161,A new disturbance has been sensed in the Temple of Light. Navigate to the temple's depths to locate the source of this energy, and you might find an unusual way of harnessing it.
val=196,The continued survival of the TzHaar race hangs in the balance. Lead a second expedition into the Elder Kiln, where the TzHaar hope to resurrect their greatest warriors by fusing them painfully with the Ga'al.
val=197,A museum archaelogist has made a potentially ground-breaking discovery. Join him to explore ancient caverns, fight legendary warriors, and become part of the most important event for thousands of years.
val=199,Team up with Veldaban and take down the villainous Red Axe.
val=10,Determine Zaros's fate as he attempts to return to Gielinor.
val=203,Help the fractured Bandosian forces choose a new leader after Bandos' death at the claws of Armadyl.
val=204,End the plague of West Ardougne and gain entry to the elf city of Prifddinas.
val=205,A dangerous ghost is terrorising a mansion and needs to be put to rest.
val=207,Zamorak is gathering a team of agents to take part in a dangerous raid.
val=208,Discover what Varrock would be like in a world without you.
val=219,Foil Nomad's dastardly scheme with the help of Death and Icthlarin.
default=null

