val=31,You must have claimed a reward from Claus for doing him a favour after completing Carnillean Rising.
val=32,
val=33,You must have completed What's Mine is Yours and all of Doric's tasks.
val=34,You must earn 'the Annihilator' title by fighting all four nihil at once, during or after Fate of the Gods.
val=35,You must find all of Zaros's memoriam crystals on Freneskae.
val=36,You must find all of Seren's memoriam crystals on Freneskae.
val=37,You must complete the Player Owned Port tutorial.
