val=39,You must construct a Tuska mask.
val=40,Complete the Hyu-Ji, Quin, Eastern Curiosities or Guardians of the World storylines from your port.
val=41,You must find all the pieces of the Reefwalker's Cape forgotten scroll.
val=42,You must recover all 15 Mahjarrat memories for Kharshai.
val=43,You must recover all 14 of Bandos's memories on Yu'biusk.
val=44,You must have defeated every boss at least once to earn the title 'the Reaper'.
val=45,You must earn the title 'of the Amlodd'.
val=46,You must earn the title 'of the Cadarn'.
val=47,You must earn the title 'of the Crwys'.
val=48,You must earn the title 'of the Hefin'.
val=49,You must earn the title 'of the Iorwerth'.
val=50,You must earn the title 'of the Ithell'.
val=51,You must earn the title 'of the Meilyr'.
val=52,You must earn the title 'of the Trahaearn'.
val=53,You must find all of the memoriam crystals in Prifddinas.
val=54,You must aid Lord Amlodd in cleansing shadow cores.
val=55,You must reconnect the Prifddinas spirit tree with her brethren.
val=56,You must help Lady Ithell with crystal singing research.
val=57,You must start helping Lady Meilyr to retrieve her lost potion recipes.
val=58,You must do well enough in Rush of Blood to impress Morvran.
val=59,You must aid Lady Trahaearn in removing some corruption.
val=60,You must have fully built the statue of Rhiannon in the Tower of Voices at least once.
val=61,You must earn the title 'Slayer Master' from Morvran's platinum Rush of Blood challenge.
