val=15,Achieve 1,250+ Conquest rank.
val=16,Sobered up Skippy.
val=17,Unlocked the full power of the Ivandis Flail.
val=18,You need to show a full set of profound armour to Lanthus.
val=19,Unlocked maximum access to Mobilising Armies rewards.
val=20,Defeated all champions.
val=21,Achieve maximum rank in each Barbarian Assault role.
val=22,Complete all court cases.
val=23,Complete 25 chimp ice deliveries.
val=24,Complete all barbarian training with Otto.
val=25,Find all barbarian notes in the Ancient Cavern.
val=26,Unlock all rewards from the Artisans' Workshop.
val=27,Obtain all circus clothing.
val=28,Complete the Dahmaroc statue in your player-owned house.
val=29,Unlock the 'Scroll of Life' trait.
val=30,Unlock the 'Scroll of Efficiency' trait.
val=31,Unlock the 'Scroll of Cleansing' trait.
val=32,Unlock the 'Scroll of Daemonheim' trait.
val=33,Unlock the 'Scroll of Proficiency' trait.
val=34,Unlock the 'Scroll of Dexterity' trait.
val=35,Unlock the 'Wild Card' trait.
val=36,Fully upgrade all Temple Trekking NPCs.
val=37,Complete all achievements in the Dominion Tower and slay the Sunfreet.
val=38,Create Char's most treasured symbol in her training cave.
val=39,Obtain rank 1 esteem from Wizard Finix.
val=40,Purchase the champion's tackle box from the Fish Flingers fisherman.
val=41,Obtain Song from the Depths' hidden rewards.
val=42,Defeat the Queen Black Dragon and obtain all four Dragonkin journals.
val=43,Explore the Eastern Lands as far as the Shield from your port.
val=44,Complete the Hyu-Ji, Quin, Eastern Curiosities and Guardians of the World storylines from your port.
val=45,You must have personally poked Vorago's eye out.
val=46,You must have survived the Shadow beneath the barrows.
val=47,You must have earned the right to wear the title 'of Daemonheim'.
val=48,You must unlock all ten elder chronicle entries.
val=49,Unlock all permanent effects from Death's Store.
val=50,You need to kill the penance king in Barbarian Assault at least once.
val=51, 
val=52,You must complete the replica statue of Rhiannon in the Max Guild garden.
val=53,You need to complete all three additional challenges from Maria in the Broken Home quest.
val=54,You need to gain all possible Prawn Perk Points for your Aquarium.
val=55,Complete Tales of the God Wars.
val=56,You must have defeated Telos at 100% enrage.
val=57, 
val=58, 
val=59, 
val=60, 
val=61, 
val=62,You must defeat the memory of Nomad and loot one of his bounty chests at least once.
val=63,Complete Tales of Nomad.
val=64,You must unlock Death Lotus gloves and boots scrolls from Waiko reward shop.
val=65,You must unlock Seasinger gloves and boots scrolls from Waiko reward shop.
val=66,You must unlock Tetsu gloves and boots scrolls from Waiko reward shop.
val=67,You must unlock the memory-crushing scrimshaw scroll from Waiko ports reward shop.
val=68,You must unlock the energy-gathering scrimshaw scroll from Waiko ports reward shop.
val=69,You must unlock the bonecrusher upgrade from Waiko reward shop.
val=70,You must unlock the ability to have all four rewards active within the Memorial to Guthix.
default=

// 10051
[enum_10051]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,Champion's Challenge: Defeat a champion.
val=1,Court Cases: Complete a case or speak to the clerk if you have completed them all.
val=2,Phoenix Lair: Defeat the phoenix.
val=3,Familiarisation: Collect your familiarisation rewards from Pikkenmix.
val=4,Treasure Trails: Complete a treasure trail.
val=5,Shooting Star: Collect your rewards from the star sprite.
val=6,Big Chinchompa: Complete a game of big chinchompa.
val=7,God Statues: Earn Prayer or Slayer XP at a God statue.
val=8,Troll Invasion: Complete a game of troll invasion.
val=9,Fish Flingers: Complete a game of fish flingers.
val=10,Sinkholes: Complete a game of sinkholes.
val=11,Wilderness Warbands: Hand a supply into Quercus.
val=12,Evil Tree: Collect your rewards from the evil tree.
val=13,Tears of Guthix: Complete a game of tears of Guthix.
val=14,Penguin Hide and Seek: Spot a penguin.
val=15,The Circus: Complete an event in the circus.
val=16,Agoroth: Defeat Agoroth.
val=17,Rune Goldberg Machine: Collect some viswax.
val=18,Rush of Blood: Complete a reward run of rush of blood.
val=19,Guthixian Caches: Complete a full round of Guthixian caches.
val=20,Bork: Defeat Bork.
val=21,Skeletal Horror: Defeat the Skeletal Horror.
val=22,Meg: Provide advice for Meg's adventures
default=

