// 10580
[enum_10580]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=5025,Are you ready to take on the #rsinstachallenge over on Instagram? Check out instagram.com/runescape for how you can get involved! #rschristmasadventure
val=5026,Are you ready to take on the #rsinstachallenge over on Instagram? Check out instagram.com/runescape for how you can get involved! #rschristmasadventure
val=5027,It's #throwbackthursday over on the #rsinstachallenge. Get nostalgic with your entries today over on Instagram! Head to instagram.com/runescape to find out more!
val=5028,Day 4 of the #rsinstachallenge is here! What do you have to do to enter today? Head over to instagram.com/runescape for the details!
val=5029,Saturdays are what the #rsinstachallenge was made for. Check out today's competition at instagram.com/runescape and give us your best Christmassy photos!
val=5030,Don't forget to tune into a special festive version of Good Morning Gielinor next Tuesday morning from 09.30 Game Time on Twitch!
val=5031,Don't forget to tune into a special festive version of Good Morning Gielinor next Tuesday morning from 09.30 Game Time on Twitch!
val=5032,WIN: A Gaming Laptop and 14 other amazing prizes with our '15 Days of Christmas' Facebook competition! Head to http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas for more information.
val=5033,Grab all kinds of awesome goodies in our '15 Days of Christmas' Facebook giveaway! Head here to enter: http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas - don't forget; if you invite your friends, you can get more chances to win!
val=5034,It's #throwbackthursday over on the #rsinstachallenge. Get nostalgic with your entries today over on instagram.com/runescape!
val=5035,Don't forget to enter to win a Gaming Laptop, handmade one-of-a-kind Dragonfire Shield, and Cooler Master goodies (and more!) - if you share and your friends enter, you get more chances to win! Check out our competition here : http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas
val=5036,Saturdays are what the #rsinstachallenge was made for. Check out today's competition on our Instagram account and give us your best Christmassy photos!
val=5037,Head to our YouTube channel (youtube.com/runescape) to check out the finalists of the Gower Quest Reward competition - which one is your favourite? The in-game poll goes live tomorrow!
val=5038,Grab yourself all kinds of Christmas goodies - a Gaming Laptop, IRL Dragonfire Shield, God Cap and more - on our '15 Days of RuneScape' Facebook competition! Head to http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas for more information
val=5039,Visit the Christmas Iceberg for party fun with Jmods - see the forum post for more details.
val=5040,WIN: A Gaming Laptop and 14 other amazing prizes with our '15 Days of Christmas' Facebook competition! Visit here for more information: http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas
val=5041,It's #throwbackthursday over on the #rsinstachallenge. Get nostalgic with your entries today over on Instagram! Head to instagram.com/runescape for more information.
val=5042,Grab yourself all kinds of Christmas goodies - a Gaming Laptop, IRL Dragonfire Shield, God Cap and more - on our '15 Days of RuneScape' Facebook competition! Head to http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas for more information.
val=5043,Saturdays are what the #rsinstachallenge was made for. Check out today's competition at instagram.com/runescape and give us your best photos!
val=5044,Don't forget to enter to win a Gaming Laptop, handmade one-of-a-kind Dragonfire Shield, and Cooler Master goodies (and more!) - if you share and your friends enter, you get more chances to win! Check out our competition here: http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas
val=5045,Day 21 of our #rsinstachallenge - are you still with us? Head over to  instagram.com/runescape to check out today's challenge!
val=5046,Visit the Christmas Iceberg for party fun with Jmods - see the forum post for more details.
val=5047,It's your last chance to enter our '15 Days of Christmas' Facebook competition! Win 15 amazing prizes this Christmas, including a Gaming Laptop and a one-of-a-kind handmade IRL Dragonfire Shield! Head here for details: http://bit.ly/RuneScape15DaysOfChristmas
val=5048,It's the final day of the #rsinstachallenge! Don't forget to check out today's challenge at instagram.com/runescape, and submit your entries - and Merry Christmas!
val=5049,Merry Christmas from us all at RuneScape! Head over to our Twitter account for a very special festive #FreeStuffFriday, launched at 20:00 Game Time!
default='Merry Christmas'<br> from the Runescape Team

// 10581
[enum_10581]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=5025,We'll be talking all-things Tutorial Island Quest in today's Developer Q&A over on Twitch - tune in from 17:00 Game Time!<br>It's set to be a titanic battle. Old School vs. RS - in a series of in-game challenges! Tune in for part one tonight from 21:00 Game Time on Twitch!
val=5026,It's set to be a titanic battle. Old School vs. RS - in a series of in-game challenges! Tune in for part two tonight from 21:00 Game Time on Twitch!<br>Visit the Christmas Iceberg for party fun with Jmods - see the forum post for more details.
val=5027,Make sure you don't miss out on Jmod events this month - check out the forum thread!
