val=5037,Don't forget to tune into a special festive version of Good Morning Gielinor next Tuesday morning from 09.30 Game Time on Twitch!
val=5038,Get your questions in for our Invention Developer Q&A tomorrow (Tuesday) at 17:00 Game Time on our forums, Reddit, or using #RSDevQA on Twitter!
val=5039,What would you like to know about Invention? Tune into our Developer Q&A today (Tuesday) from 17:00 Game Time on Twitch!
